%% 切换前历史快照：不得作为当前生产合同；当前仅 InteractionFrame/v2
sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant Go as Go 权威事实
participant Helix as Helix DialogListFrameState
participant Builder as V1 Frame Builder
participant Bus as Tauri im:interaction:frame
participant Codec as Angular Codec
participant Runtime as SurfaceRuntime
participant UI as 左侧会话列表

Go->>Helix: 单频道 update_channel 等事件
Helix->>Helix: HashMap 更新目标 row
Helix->>Helix: retain + position + insert 重排 O(n)
Helix->>Helix: 生成 UpsertRow/MoveRow
Helix-->>Helix: operations 被赋给 _legacy_patch 后丢弃
Helix->>Helix: interaction_view 遍历全部 n 行
Helix->>Builder: DialogListPatch replaceView(DialogListVm)
Builder->>Bus: schemaVersion=1 完整列表 payload
Bus->>Codec: InteractionFrame
Codec->>Codec: 仅接受 replaceView
Codec->>Runtime: 完整 DialogListVm
Runtime->>Runtime: baseRevision 校验后替换整个 VM
Runtime->>UI: 重新绑定全部 section/items

Note over Go,Helix: 在线事件不是每次全表读库
Note over Helix,UI: 但组装、传输与应用仍随总行数 n 增长
